{"ref":"BDB, שִׂיחָה","hw":"שִׂיחָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. id.</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:99\" href=\"/Psalms.119.99\">ψ 119:99</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:4\" href=\"/Job.15.4\">Jb 15:4</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:97\" href=\"/Psalms.119.97\">ψ 119:97</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>complaint:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ לִפְנֵי־אֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:4\" href=\"/Job.15.4\">Jb 15:4</a>; (so Bu al., cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שִׂיחַ²\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׂיחַ²\", dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</a> <strong>1</strong> De al. <em>meditation</em>, cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּרַע\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּרַע\", dir=\"rtl\">גָּרַע</a>]).<br><strong>2.</strong>  (obj. of) <em>musing, study:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:97\" href=\"/Psalms.119.97\">ψ 119:97</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדוּת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:99\" href=\"/Psalms.119.99\">99</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׂיחַ²","prev":"BDB, שִׂיחַ"}